Famous Last Words.

Let's work on some YASD dangers and how to avoid them:

1) You are going around as a Xorn - which is quite risky.
Few HP. no magic cancellation, probably no magic resistance.
If you get unpolymorphed through HP loss, you will lose a LOT
of your native HP.  A single step on a magic trap and your promising
game could go down the tubes.
2) Safest form for exploring unknown areas until you have a full AK
is crystal golem - you know this already.  Crystal golems have
enough HP(300) to safely wear unchanging, as well as tons of
helpful intrinsics and a breath attack.  They cannot explore as
quickly as Xorns - nothing can, but they are immune to most of
the insta-deaths.  Remember, you can #youpoly back into a
human and again into a new crystal golem to recover lost HP.
3) Once you are going around as an unchanging CG, you can
work on the rest of your AK.  You will want -
a) An adequate melee weapon - Saccing for the Bat is a good
idea. Enchant it to +3 or better. Serpent's Tongue is a passable
substitute, if you can enchant it up to +7.
b) The Gauntlets of Defense - get them and Enchant them up.
c) The blessed Wallet of Perseus - worth an early wish.
d) An adequate ranged attack - a stack of daggers might suffice,
but the artifact Plague is ideal - you might wish for it.
e) Critical spells - You will want to learn as many spells as you
can, but never read a spellbook that might be cursed. A partial
list of helpful low-level spells: force bolt,magic missile,sleep,
jumping, charm monster, haste self, cure sickness,stone-to-flesh.
f) Elbereth - find a way to engrave/burn it soon - wand or athame.
g) chameleons - can be very nasty, =oPfSC might help
h) Levitation - not essential since you can fly/LLeap.
i) Stoning grenades - a female basilisk can provide you with
the ultimate weapons.  Collect some food, lay about 60 of
these, put them in a bag, and take them out one at a time.

Be careful and you can easily ascend this one.

Happy Hacking.



